 Title: How to Clean Your Wig with Hot Water and Special Liquids!

Hey there, little buddy! Today, we're going to learn how to clean your wig using hot water and some special liquids. Just like how you take care of your toys, your wig needs some love and attention too! So, let's get started!

First, we need three bowls. One big one and two smaller ones. We'll fill the big bowl with hot water, and the two smaller ones with different special liquids. Can you help me fill the bowls? Great job!

Now, we need to add some Clorox bleach to the first bowl. This will help clean your wig and make it sparkly clean! Can you pour the bleach into the bowl? Good job!

